msgid "Maximum Author Pages:"
msgstr "Maximálny počet stránok autora:"

#: data/interfaces/bookstrap/config.html:2924
msgid ""
"How many pages of the book list of an author are read from the info source, "
"0 for all of them."
msgstr ""
"Koľko stránok zoznamu kníh autora sa načíta zo zdroja informácií; 0 pre "
"všetky."

#: data/interfaces/bookstrap/config.html:2927
